Firmware for the AMD XDNA neural processing units (NPU) of Ryzen AI
processors: Phoenix and Hawk Point (1022:1502), Strix Point and Strix
Halo (1022:17f0).  The amdxdna driver hands it to the
platform security processor at attach.  The files come from
linux-firmware and are installed as raw files under /boot/firmware/amdnpu/,
where firmware(9) loads them on demand.
